free; run and use it for free; redistribute for free, from any source
(hand-to-hand, mirrors, app repositories, media), any copy whose SHA-256
checksum matches the one the Author published for that version (i.e. an
unmodified official release file) — a self-built copy may be handed to
others directly but must not be published as "Zen" or presented as an
official release; report bugs; and submit pull requests to the official
repository (granting the Author a non-exclusive, royalty-free right to use
them).

You MAY NOT, without the Author's prior written permission: modify the
Software or create and distribute derivative works (local changes, and a
GitHub fork, solely to prepare a pull request are allowed); remove, hide,
replace or redirect the Author's fundraising links/details or the
authorship/copyright notices; add your own fundraising, donation prompts,
ads or analytics; sell the Software, charge for it or offer it as part of a
paid product or service (simply using the app, including at work, is
allowed); remove or bypass security measures or distribute modified builds
as "Zen"; or use the "Zen" name/logo to imply the Author endorses a
non-official build.

The Author reserves all rights not expressly granted. Rights end
automatically on any breach. The Software is provided "AS IS", without
warranty of any kind. Polish law governs this license.
